# These files execute on Linux (CHTC execute nodes, inside the container).
# A CRLF from a Windows checkout makes bash fail on "\r", and make keeps the
# \r in every variable, so a CRLF Makefile turns PLATFORM into "linux/amd64\r"
# and every docker build dies on an invalid platform. Same reasoning as
# ../training/.gitattributes.
* text=auto eol=lf
Makefile text eol=lf
submit.sh text eol=lf
train.sub text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
